      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "c7a485c3b89aca15d536af15b81e5045fd2e96d72ab263dbe57066fbb336c1cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Consider the balanced design in which n half sibs are assayed from each of N males, so that there are a total T = Nn individuals in the analysis. The quantity",
