      "content": "are the observed among- and within-family mean squares. Substitution of observed mean squares for their expectations in Equations 18.10a,b yields the following unbiased estimators of $ \\sigma_{s}^{2} $, $ \\sigma_{e}^{2} $, and $ \\sigma_{z}^{2} $,",
