      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "In principle, correction for this bias can be made by substituting the observed $ t_{PHS} $ for $ \\tau $ in the preceding expression and adding the estimated bias $ \\Delta_{t} $ to $ t_{PHS} $ prior to estimating the heritability with Equation 18.14. The bias in $ t_{PHS} $ can be considerable if N is very small (less than 20), but for larger designs it is generally no more than a few percent.",
